skill.core.leadership.description.advanc:
{Advanced Leadership}

Increases the {Morale} of all creatures in the hero's army by {+2}.

{Inspired March}: visiting an adventure map object that grants a {positive} {Morale} bonus for the next battle also grants {+200} movement points.

